# G-PID 标准线型表（AutoCAD 式，世界单位）
# G-PID standard linetype table (AutoCAD-style, world units)
#
# 格式 / Format:
#   名称 = 描述            name = description
#   A,on,off,on,off,...    dash/space lengths (world units)
# 数值与 GPEdgeStyle 的信号虚线同一单位体系，使全部线型共用一套尺度。
# Values share GPEdgeStyle's signal-dash unit system so every line style uses one scale.
# CONTINUOUS = 实线（无空白） Solid line (no gaps)
A,0.0
HIDDEN = 隐藏线（短划） Hidden line — short dashes
A,12.0,6.0
DASHED = 虚线 Dashed line
A,18.0,6.0
CENTER = 中心线（长划点·点） Center line — long dash dot dot
A,28.0,6.0,3.0,6.0,3.0,6.0
PHANTOM =  Phantom 线（长·短·短） Phantom line — long short short
A,32.0,6.0,3.0,6.0,3.0,6.0
DOT = 点线 Dotted line
A,0.0,4.0
